></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">What am I getting?</button><div id="faq-answer-1" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">Our AI Shopify Store builder will provide you a FREE AI Shopify dropshipping store! In addition, you will receive winning products proven to sell, a high converting &amp; customizable theme, ready to sell pages, premium apps &amp; sales badges, 24/7 customer support, and you get to keep 100% of your profits, all for free!</div></div></div></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">Is there any store cost or commission fee since it’s created for free?</button><div id="faq-answer-2" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">Our Shopify stores are provided to you for free with the help of our Ai store builder tool. You make 0 payments to Dropship. You retain 100% of your profits! However, if you decide to continue using Shopify, you will need to pay for a Shopify plan directly with Shopify. Check out their pricing plans here:<!-- --> <a href="https://www.shopify.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.shopify.com/pricing</a></div></div></div></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">Will Dropship set up the Terms and Conditions for my store?</button><div id="faq-answer-3" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">Our free Shopify stores come with terms and conditions templates, that you can use or customize after receiving your store.</div></div></div></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">Can I add more products to my Shopify store?</button><div id="faq-answer-4" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">Certainly, you can add as many products as you want once you get the credentials for your Shopify store. Our AI Shopify Store Builder will provide you the minimal amount of dropshipping products to start with.</div></div></div></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">Is it possible to create a custom domain and link it to my Shopify store?</button><div id="faq-answer-5" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">Of course! Your AI Shopify store comes with a premium .store domain - used by Mr. Beast, Rihanna, and the top 1% of e-commerce giants - and it&#x27;s free. Why waste time and money buying one when you can click the button above and claim your free .store domain instantly?</div></div></div></div><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__item"><button type="button" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__question " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">I’ve lost my password!</button><div id="faq-answer-6" class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answer " role="region"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerInner"><div class="Faq-module__pkI36W__answerText">When you forget your password, simply select &#x27;Forgot Password,&#x27; and our system will send you an email to instantly reset it with a new one.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="Footer-module__S6Hkya__footer"><div class="Footer-module__S6